circ.hearing.cards.6.text [9ea7ef] = 光有理论不够。对方要亲眼看见。
# en: Under the Lamp
circ.hearing.cards.7.title [31e340] = 灯下
# en: The room is warm, the questions are slow, and your voice is going.
circ.hearing.cards.7.text [ea8f29] = 屋里很暖，问题很慢，你的嗓子渐渐哑了。
# en: A Generous Reading
circ.hearing.cards.8.title [957702] = 善意解读
# en: Someone on the panel wants to be on your side, if you give them the words.
circ.hearing.cards.8.text [51569e] = 有人愿意站在你这边，只等你递过去合适的话。
# en: First Principles
circ.hearing.cards.9.title [c205f2] = 基本原理
# en: They take it all the way back to the beginning, and wait.
circ.hearing.cards.9.text [bf6d08] = 对方把话题一路拉回开头，然后等着。
# en: The Hourglass
circ.hearing.cards.10.title [0d6c4e] = 沙漏
# en: The sand is running and the work is not finished.
circ.hearing.cards.10.text [a356b9] = 沙子不断落下，工作却还没做完。
# en: Credentials
circ.hearing.cards.11.title [c38d71] = 资历
# en: Only someone who truly knows the field gets a hearing.
circ.hearing.cards.11.text [a1c2fa] = 只有真正懂行的人，才值得一听。
# en: Show Me the Spell
circ.hearing.demands.0.title [59e4cb] = 施法给我看
# en: They will believe it when they see it cast.
circ.hearing.demands.0.text [02f8e7] = 亲眼看见法术施放，对方才会相信。
# en: Authority
circ.authority.name [027de6] = 权威
# en: The Rule Stands
circ.authority.crux.title [b3a8c3] = 规定照旧
# en: The rules don’t bend. You need a reason they should, this once.
circ.authority.crux.text [df813a] = 规定不会自己弯腰。你得给一个破例的理由。
# en: Procedure
circ.authority.cards.0.title [492f6e] = 程序
# en: There is a proper way to ask for this, and you have not followed it.
circ.authority.cards.0.text [9f158e] = 提出这件事有正规途径，而你没有照办。
# en: No Exceptions
circ.authority.cards.1.title [2c003c] = 概不破例
# en: Bend the rule once, and everyone will want it bent.
circ.authority.cards.1.text [af78a4] = 破例一次，往后人人都会来要求。
# en: Your Record
circ.authority.cards.2.title [60d8cb] = 你的记录
# en: It is all in a file, and the file is not kind.
circ.authority.cards.2.text [981cae] = 一切都在档案里，而档案并不客气。
# en: The Letter of It
circ.authority.cards.3.title [38fcf2] = 白纸黑字
# en: What is written says otherwise, and they mean to follow what is written.
circ.authority.cards.3.text [7d6531] = 文字明明写着相反的意思，对方打算照字面执行。
# en: A Quiet Word
circ.authority.cards.4.title [aae91c] = 私下说几句
# en: If it can be settled without anyone writing it down, they are listening.
circ.authority.cards.4.text [70402d] = 若能不留记录就办妥，对方倒愿意听听。
# en: Precedent
circ.authority.cards.5.title [55d4ab] = 先例
# en: Grant it once and it will be quoted back at them for years.
circ.authority.cards.5.text [b66839] = 这次一准，往后几年都会有人拿来当例子。
# en: Deference
circ.authority.cards.6.title [6ddb98] = 礼数
# en: They expect to be addressed properly, and first.
circ.authority.cards.6.text [02dc47] = 对方希望你称呼得体，而且先向自己致意。
# en: The Ledger
circ.authority.cards.7.title [a7397d] = 账簿
# en: The numbers say what they say, and they are written in ink.
circ.authority.cards.7.text [d14ce5] = 数字就是数字，还都用墨水写着。
# en: Above Their Head
circ.authority.cards.8.title [96d9f0] = 上头的人
# en: Somebody higher up will read this, and they know it.
circ.authority.cards.8.text [ecfc60] = 有更高一层的人会读到这件事，对方也知道。
# en: Office Hours
circ.authority.cards.9.title [2f554a] = 办公时间
# en: Others are waiting, and the clock on the wall is loud.
circ.authority.cards.9.text [46bdd3] = 外面还有人在等，墙上的钟响得格外清楚。
# en: Clean Hands
circ.authority.cards.10.title [436304] = 手上干净
# en: They need to be able to say they did it properly.
circ.authority.cards.10.text [3a5ad0] = 对方必须能说，自己一切都按规矩办了。
# en: A Fee
circ.authority.demands.0.title [09c654] = 费用
# en: There is a fee for this, and it is not waived.
circ.authority.demands.0.text [31ff2c] = 这事要收费，而且不予减免。
# en: Who Are You?
circ.authority.demands.1.title [9894fb] = 你是哪位
# en: They only deal with people whose names they know.
circ.authority.demands.1.text [dbf28d] = 对方只同听过名字的人办事。
# en: A deal
circ.trade.name [b65202] = 交易
# en: Their Price
circ.trade.crux.title [e681aa] = 对方的价
# en: Nothing leaves this table for less than it is worth to them.
circ.trade.crux.text [9cfee3] = 桌上没有什么会低于对方心里的价钱卖出去。
# en: The Opening Price
circ.trade.cards.0.title [c8d699] = 开价
# en: The first figure is a joke, and you are meant to laugh.
circ.trade.cards.0.text [2ef9f1] = 第一个数字是个笑话，而你本该笑。
# en: Other Buyers
circ.trade.cards.1.title [c4f3d7] = 别的买家
# en: Someone else is interested, or so they say.
circ.trade.cards.1.text [660581] = 还有别人感兴趣，至少对方这么说。
# en: The Going Rate
circ.trade.cards.2.title [906c98] = 市价
# en: Your figure does not match what these things are worth.
circ.trade.cards.2.text [8d8daf] = 你报的数字，和这些东西的价值不符。
# en: Worth Their While
circ.trade.cards.3.title [a26b76] = 值得一做
# en: It has to be worth their while.
circ.trade.cards.3.text [469a3b] = 这桩买卖得让对方觉得值得。
# en: The Walk Away
circ.trade.cards.4.title [d919e1] = 转身就走
# en: You could leave. They need to believe you will.
circ.trade.cards.4.text [4ab616] = 你可以离开。对方得相信你真会走。
# en: Quality
circ.trade.cards.5.title [7fbec6] = 成色
# en: They turn it slowly in the light to show you it is the real thing.
circ.trade.cards.5.text [5e8746] = 东西在光下慢慢转动，好证明它是货真价实的。
# en: A Sweetener
circ.trade.cards.6.title [744000] = 添点甜头
# en: A little extra on the side would smooth things.
circ.trade.cards.6.text [865765] = 旁边再添一点，一切就好商量了。
# en: An Old Debt
circ.trade.cards.7.title [bfcb54] = 旧债
# en: Something is still owed from last time.
circ.trade.cards.7.text [ad9e0b] = 上一次的账，还有些没清。
# en: The Scales
circ.trade.cards.8.title [e04b67] = 秤砣
# en: Their weights are not quite honest, and they know you know.
circ.trade.cards.8.text [0d78ba] = 秤砣不太老实，对方也知道你看出来了。
# en: Back and Forth
circ.trade.cards.9.title [8fa654] = 来来回回
# en: Every number you name is somewhere for them to start.
circ.trade.cards.9.text [92c732] = 你每报一个数，对方就又有了起头的地方。
# en: In Writing
circ.trade.cards.10.title [52967e] = 落到纸上
# en: Get it written down, or it never happened.
circ.trade.cards.10.text [12cc66] = 不写下来，就等于没发生过。
# en: Cash on the Table
circ.trade.demands.0.title [fc88d0] = 现钱上桌
# en: Nothing moves until something changes hands.
circ.trade.demands.0.text [07421b] = 东西不过手，事情就不动。
# en: A Reference
circ.trade.demands.1.title [c17259] = 名声作保
# en: They deal with people of some reputation.
circ.trade.demands.1.text [9189f4] = 对方只跟有些名望的人做买卖。
# en: A matter of the heart
circ.heart.name [d5a0b9] = 心事
# en: What It Means
circ.heart.crux.title [e0386e] = 这意味着什么
# en: This is not about winning. They need to know you mean it.
circ.heart.crux.text [3398ee] = 不是争输赢。对方需要知道你是认真的。
# en: The Hurt
circ.heart.cards.0.title [535c25] = 伤处
# en: Whatever you say, they will hear the thing you did first.
circ.heart.cards.0.text [3f73b0] = 无论你说什么，对方都会先听见你曾做过的事。
# en: History
circ.heart.cards.1.title [96597f] = 过往
# en: Everything that has passed between you is in the room.
circ.heart.cards.1.text [24b35f] = 你们之间发生过的一切，此刻都在房间里。
# en: The Promise
circ.heart.cards.2.title [f2b21d] = 承诺
# en: You promised once. They remember the words exactly.
circ.heart.cards.2.text [98548d] = 你曾许过诺。对方记得每一个字。
# en: A Joke Too Many
circ.heart.cards.3.title [f7f500] = 玩笑过头
# en: You reach for a joke, and they see you reach.
circ.heart.cards.3.text [bdc866] = 你试着开个玩笑，对方看得一清二楚。
# en: Someone Else
circ.heart.cards.4.title [df0e24] = 另一个人
# en: There is someone else in this, even if they are not here.
circ.heart.cards.4.text [84ddad] = 这件事里还有别人，即使那人并不在场。
# en: The Quiet
circ.heart.cards.5.title [a140ac] = 安静
# en: Neither of you speaks for a long time.
circ.heart.cards.5.text [61a4a0] = 你们都许久没有说话。
# en: A Small Kindness
circ.heart.cards.6.title [e75950] = 一点体贴
# en: Tea, a blanket, a hand on the shoulder.
circ.heart.cards.6.text [696451] = 茶，毯子，肩上的一只手。
# en: What You Said
circ.heart.cards.7.title [0d53c9] = 你说过的话
# en: Something you said months ago, given back word for word.
circ.heart.cards.7.text [37aff2] = 几个月前的话，如今一字不差地还给你。
# en: All of It
circ.heart.cards.8.title [e67e2a] = 全部真相
# en: They want the whole truth, including the part you left out.
circ.heart.cards.8.text [295c9d] = 对方想知道全部真相，包括你没说的那部分。
# en: Family
circ.heart.cards.9.title [6f8f49] = 家人
# en: Their family is in this too, and has opinions.
circ.heart.cards.9.text [5e2f16] = 对方的家人也牵涉其中，而且各有想法。
# en: The Door
circ.heart.cards.10.title [e7809c] = 门
# en: They keep glancing at the door.
circ.heart.cards.10.text [999311] = 对方不断朝门口望去。
# en: A Real Promise
circ.heart.cards.11.title [da8b89] = 真正的承诺
# en: Words will not do. They need to see what you are to each other.
circ.heart.cards.11.text [5eff45] = 光说不够。对方要看见，你们对彼此究竟意味着什么。
# en: Help, Not Words
circ.heart.demands.0.title [a5107e] = 帮忙，不是空话
# en: What they need is practical, and it costs.
circ.heart.demands.0.text [10b4d2] = 对方需要实际的帮助，而实际的帮助要花钱。
# en: In front of a crowd
circ.crowd.name [475454] = 众人面前
# en: The Room
circ.crowd.crux.title [6aea2f] = 满堂人心
# en: The room has made up its mind about you. Change it.
circ.crowd.crux.text [ae7b24] = 满屋子的人对你已有看法。改变它。
# en: The Laugh
circ.crowd.cards.0.title [5b27fd] = 笑声
# en: The room is laughing, and it is laughing at you.
circ.crowd.cards.0.text [bf5da9] = 全场在笑，笑的是你。
# en: A Heckler
circ.crowd.cards.1.title [e1676c] = 起哄者
# en: Something from the back of the room pulls every eye away.
circ.crowd.cards.1.text [ecfcea] = 后排传来一句话，夺走了所有目光。
# en: A Toast
circ.crowd.cards.2.title [095cb3] = 祝酒
# en: Glasses are raised, and everyone waits for you to say something.
circ.crowd.cards.2.text [cfa867] = 酒杯都举了起来，众人等着你说些什么。
# en: A Rumour
circ.crowd.cards.3.title [6e5ba6] = 流言
# en: Someone is passing something along, behind a hand.
circ.crowd.cards.3.text [26cfc1] = 有人掩着嘴，把什么话传了下去。
# en: The Rival
circ.crowd.cards.4.title [952ad0] = 竞争者
# en: Someone else here wants the room more than you do.
circ.crowd.cards.4.text [1b1b83] = 这里还有人，比你更想赢得全场。
# en: Manners
circ.crowd.cards.5.title [ab50f9] = 礼仪
# en: Which fork, which title, which order. Everyone is watching.
circ.crowd.cards.5.text [1c80e6] = 哪把叉，哪个称呼，什么次序。所有人都看着。
# en: Masks
circ.crowd.cards.6.title [38468e] = 面具
# en: Nobody here is quite who they seem.
circ.crowd.cards.6.text [4db520] = 这里的人，谁也不完全像表面那样。
# en: Your Story
circ.crowd.cards.7.title [56376b] = 你的故事
# en: They want it told well, with an ending.
circ.crowd.cards.7.text [995fe5] = 对方想听个好故事，还得有个结尾。
# en: Your Name
circ.crowd.cards.8.title [ad18dd] = 你的名字
# en: They have heard of you, and not only good things.
circ.crowd.cards.8.text [7c11df] = 对方听过你的名字，不全是好事。
# en: The Hush
circ.crowd.cards.9.title [510138] = 全场寂静
# en: The whole room goes quiet to hear what you say next.
circ.crowd.cards.9.text [2b5ac2] = 满屋子都静下来，等着你下一句话。
# en: The Crowd Turns
circ.crowd.cards.10.title [2584e5] = 风向转变
# en: Half the room is with you now. Half is not.
circ.crowd.cards.10.text [dcf14b] = 一半人在你这边，另一半还没有。
# en: Who Are You?
circ.crowd.demands.0.title [9894fb] = 你是哪位
# en: This room only listens to names it knows.
circ.crowd.demands.0.text [86c97e] = 这屋子只听熟悉的名字说话。
# en: A Round for the Room
circ.crowd.demands.1.title [b0634b] = 请全场喝一轮
# en: Nothing warms a room like being paid for.
circ.crowd.demands.1.text [514adb] = 再没有比别人付账，更能暖场的了。
# en: On the record
circ.ink.name [178d10] = 记录在案
# en: The Story
circ.ink.crux.title [36ab01] = 报道
# en: It will be printed one way or another. Make it the true one.
circ.ink.crux.text [1e5d72] = 无论如何都会见报。让它成为真实的版本。
# en: The Deadline
circ.ink.cards.0.title [bf99e8] = 截稿时间
# en: The presses run at dawn, with you or without you.
circ.ink.cards.0.text [36eadc] = 印刷机天亮就转，有没有你都一样。
# en: Red Ink
circ.ink.cards.1.title [025680] = 红墨水
# en: A whole paragraph, struck through without a word.
circ.ink.cards.1.text [1e258d] = 整整一段，被一声不响地划掉了。
# en: On the Record
circ.ink.cards.2.title [6a1830] = 记录在案
# en: Every word you say is being written down.
circ.ink.cards.2.text [233f46] = 你说的每个字，都有人记着。
# en: A Quote
circ.ink.cards.3.title [f0cea0] = 一句引言
# en: They need one good line, and they need it from you.
circ.ink.cards.3.text [c6ee8f] = 对方需要一句好话，而且非得出自你口。
# en: No Comment
circ.ink.cards.4.title [dea303] = 无可奉告
# en: Someone is denying everything, including the obvious.
circ.ink.cards.4.text [2f44d5] = 有人否认一切，连明摆着的事也不承认。
# en: The Facts
circ.ink.cards.5.title [610a23] = 事实
# en: Names, dates, and the order things happened in.
circ.ink.cards.5.text [9b629b] = 姓名，日期，事情发生的先后。
# en: The Angle
circ.ink.cards.6.title [c80d4f] = 报道角度
# en: There is a better story here than the true one, and they can smell it.
circ.ink.cards.6.text [1456ae] = 比真相更好看的故事就在这里，对方闻得出来。
# en: A Source
circ.ink.cards.7.title [905c61] = 消息来源
# en: Someone told them in confidence. Whose side are you on?
circ.ink.cards.7.text [6c27c5] = 有人私下向对方透露了消息。你站在哪一边？
# en: The Headline
circ.ink.cards.8.title [22a22c] = 标题
# en: Six words in large type, and they decide everything.
circ.ink.cards.8.text [6ad0ec] = 几个醒目的大字，就能决定一切。
# en: Spelled Right
circ.ink.cards.9.title [757bc2] = 拼写无误
# en: Your name, at least, should be spelled correctly.
circ.ink.cards.9.text [c24fb9] = 至少，你的名字该写对。
# en: The Column
circ.ink.cards.10.title [baf946] = 专栏
# en: There is space for only so many words, and yours are too many.
circ.ink.cards.10.text [301926] = 版面只有这么大，而你的话太多。
# en: Know Your Subject
circ.ink.cards.11.title [8a2e99] = 了解你的主题
# en: They will not print it unless you know what you are talking about.
circ.ink.cards.11.text [d4507a] = 除非你确实懂自己在说什么，否则对方不会刊登。
# en: A Byline
circ.ink.demands.0.title [79f58b] = 署名
# en: Readers trust a name they have seen before.
circ.ink.demands.0.text [43d0d3] = 读者信任曾经见过的名字。
# en: In the wild
circ.wild.name [cc3bff] = 荒野
# en: The Old Courtesy
circ.wild.crux.title [36ffa5] = 古老礼数
# en: It does not care what you want. It cares whether you have been proper about it.
circ.wild.crux.text [b0a1a7] = 它不在乎你想要什么，只在乎你有没有依礼行事。
# en: A Riddle
circ.wild.cards.0.title [5e03c6] = 谜语
# en: A question with an answer, and the answer is not the obvious one.
circ.wild.cards.0.text [1fec28] = 一个有答案的问题，但答案绝不是显而易见的那个。
# en: The Wrong Answer
circ.wild.cards.1.title [10f135] = 错误答案
# en: It has heard every clever answer. It wants the right one.
circ.wild.cards.1.text [bff72d] = 聪明话它都听过了。它想要正确的答案。
# en: Courtesy
circ.wild.cards.2.title [a3f04f] = 礼貌
# en: You have not yet bowed, and it has noticed.
circ.wild.cards.2.text [cb5614] = 你还没有鞠躬，而它注意到了。
# en: A Trick
circ.wild.cards.3.title [898163] = 圈套
# en: It offers you something, and it is clearly a trick.
circ.wild.cards.3.text [990dd2] = 它给你一样东西，显然是个圈套。
# en: Old Names
circ.wild.cards.4.title [0c960e] = 旧名
# en: It wants to be called by its proper name.
circ.wild.cards.4.text [b6159e] = 它想听见自己真正的名字。
# en: A Gift
circ.wild.cards.5.title [2e3922] = 礼物
# en: Something given freely, or not at all.
circ.wild.cards.5.text [5ef127] = 要么自愿给予，要么干脆不给。
# en: Stillness
circ.wild.cards.6.title [5cf186] = 岿然不动
# en: It moves toward you, and you must not step back.
circ.wild.cards.6.text [303fa9] = 它朝你靠近，你不能后退。
# en: The Bargain
circ.wild.cards.7.title [6a091a] = 约定
# en: Every word of the bargain matters, and some of them are hiding.
circ.wild.cards.7.text [de7cc1] = 约定里的每个字都重要，有些字还藏着别的意思。
# en: Spellwork
circ.wild.cards.8.title [53fc84] = 施展法术
# en: The air is thick with something old. It wants to see what you can do with it.
circ.wild.cards.8.text [780611] = 空气中弥漫着古老的力量。它想看看你能做什么。
# en: A Change of Mood
circ.wild.cards.9.title [23d620] = 性情骤变
# en: Its temper turns like weather.
circ.wild.cards.9.text [b4d8a1] = 它的脾气，变得像天气一样快。
# en: In Circles
circ.wild.cards.10.title [224953] = 兜圈子
# en: It has led you in a circle, to see if you notice.
circ.wild.cards.10.text [22da62] = 它领你绕了一圈，想看看你有没有察觉。
# en: Show Me Your Magic
circ.wild.demands.0.title [09db6e] = 让我看看你的魔法
# en: It will listen to a spell before it listens to words.
circ.wild.demands.0.text [09a1cf] = 它愿意先听法术，再听话语。
# en: A Toll
circ.wild.demands.1.title [42f9cd] = 过路费
# en: Nobody passes without paying something.
circ.wild.demands.1.text [df6c07] = 谁也不能不付代价就过去。
# en: A Drop of Blood
circ.wild.demands.2.title [cc406a] = 一滴血
# en: What it wants of you will hurt to give.
circ.wild.demands.2.text [9d4eca] = 它要的东西，给出去会疼。
# en: In the shadow
circ.shadow.name [f8114b] = 阴影
# en: The Grip
circ.shadow.crux.title [a53b18] = 掌控
# en: They hold something, or someone. Words are all you have to loosen it.
circ.shadow.crux.text [41f122] = 对方握着某样东西，或某个人。你只有话语能使它松动。
# en: The Threat
circ.shadow.cards.0.title [70177c] = 威胁
# en: Nothing is said outright. Nothing needs to be.
circ.shadow.cards.0.text [17f801] = 没有一句话说透，也没有必要说透。
# en: Cold
circ.shadow.cards.1.title [72bc2f] = 寒冷
# en: Frost creeps along every edge, and your breath is short.
circ.shadow.cards.1.text [692ea6] = 霜沿着每道边缘爬来，你的呼吸短促起来。
# en: Leverage
circ.shadow.cards.2.title [302342] = 把柄
# en: They know something about you, and want you to know they know.
circ.shadow.cards.2.text [d4358f] = 对方知道你的某件事，也想让你知道这一点。
# en: A Lie
circ.shadow.cards.3.title [06aab2] = 谎言
# en: Something they said is false, and it is the part that matters.
circ.shadow.cards.3.text [24e112] = 对方说的有一处不真，偏偏是最要紧的那处。
# en: Old Family
circ.shadow.cards.4.title [11f076] = 旧家族
# en: Old names, old debts, and an old way of settling them.
circ.shadow.cards.4.text [9b6e50] = 古老的名字，古老的债，还有古老的清账方式。
# en: The Offer
circ.shadow.cards.5.title [d66d52] = 提议
# en: They offer you something you want. That is the danger.
circ.shadow.cards.5.text [0c013e] = 对方给你想要的东西。危险就在这里。
# en: Under a Spell
circ.shadow.cards.6.title [b728b0] = 受咒之人
# en: Someone here is not speaking for themselves.
circ.shadow.cards.6.text [27089b] = 这里有人，说的并不是自己的话。
# en: Doubt
circ.shadow.cards.7.title [2ac8f5] = 怀疑
# en: What if they are right?
circ.shadow.cards.7.text [ff8f99] = 万一对方是对的呢？
# en: Nerve
circ.shadow.cards.8.title [f277e3] = 胆量
# en: They step closer, and keep stepping.
circ.shadow.cards.8.text [fbd481] = 对方走近一步，又一步。
# en: A Crack
circ.shadow.cards.9.title [2a71f2] = 裂缝
# en: Their certainty slips for a moment. Only a moment.
circ.shadow.cards.9.text [dccfb2] = 对方的笃定松了一瞬。只有一瞬。
# en: No Witnesses
circ.shadow.cards.10.title [36b661] = 没有证人
# en: Nobody else is here, and nobody else would believe you.
circ.shadow.cards.10.text [479252] = 这里没有别人，就算有，也没人会信你。
# en: Prove Your Power
circ.shadow.cards.11.title [933925] = 证明力量
# en: They respect only what they can see you do.
circ.shadow.cards.11.text [3961ce] = 对方只尊重亲眼见你做出的事。
# en: A Price in Blood
circ.shadow.demands.0.title [607090] = 血的代价
# en: Some debts are not paid in coin.
circ.shadow.demands.0.text [de7144] = 有些债，不收钱。
# en: Compulsion
hex.compel.title [ad3f06] = 强迫术
# en: His voice is very reasonable. You find yourself agreeing with it.
hex.compel.text [614a21] = 他的声音很有道理。你发觉自己正在赞同。
# en: Lands: you lose
hex.compel.short [69e113] = 生效：谈判失败
# en: You agree to everything, in a voice not your own. The meeting is lost.
hex.compel.lands [390834] = 你用不属于自己的声音答应了一切。谈判失败。
# en: Bewitched
hex.bewitch.title [0c6902] = 迷惑
# en: Something sweet in the air makes your best points sound foolish.
hex.bewitch.text [0b5337] = 空气里有种甜味，让你最好的论据也显得可笑。
# en: Lands: the crux −3
hex.bewitch.short [7d4f2d] = 生效：核心 −3
# en: Your best points sound foolish now: −3 Agreement.
hex.bewitch.lands [16318d] = 你最好的论据如今显得可笑：−3 认同。
# en: A Hush
hex.hush.title [99c3a8] = 噤声
# en: A quiet settles on your hands, the kind that smothers spells.
hex.hush.text [a015f2] = 一片寂静落在你手上，足以闷灭法术。
# en: Lands: no more spells
hex.hush.short [d8d228] = 生效：无法再施法
# en: Your magic is smothered: no more spells this meeting.
hex.hush.lands [40d12c] = 你的魔法被压住了：这场谈判不能再施法。
# en: Light Fingers
hex.lightfingers.title [fc7fa5] = 妙手
# en: A charm on the purse strings, while you’re busy talking.
hex.lightfingers.text [6fa0e9] = 你忙着说话时，钱袋绳上已经多了道咒。
# en: Lands: your purse
hex.lightfingers.short [79ea87] = 生效：钱袋受损
# en: Your purse is lighter, and so is your Mana.
hex.lightfingers.lands [3e2f95] = 你的钱袋轻了，法力也是。
# en: Their Share
common.0.title [6c38b8] = 对方那份
# en: They can see what you gain. They can’t yet see what they do.
common.0.text [7678e5] = 对方看得见你能得到什么，却还看不见自己的好处。
# en: Too Good to Be True
common.1.title [00f2cc] = 好得不像真的
# en: It sounds too good, and in their experience it usually is.
common.1.text [46d1d9] = 听上去太好。而对方的经验说，多半好得不真。
# en: Loose Terms
common.2.title [012256] = 含糊条款
# en: Your words are doing more work than your meaning.
common.2.text [fdc33d] = 你的话语，替本意多干了不少活。
# en: A Contradiction
common.3.title [86922d] = 前后矛盾
# en: Two of your best points can’t both be true.
common.3.text [375ba5] = 你最有力的两条论据，不可能同时成立。
# en: Silence
common.4.title [177b2c] = 沉默
# en: Nothing comes back across the table. The quiet is doing the work.
common.4.text [5e5eaa] = 桌子那头没有回答。沉默正在替对方做事。
# en: The Point
common.5.title [6e9cea] = 说重点
# en: They have stopped listening to the preamble.
common.5.text [51330d] = 对方已经不再听开场白了。
